# Lab 7 BR2_EXTERNAL tree — no custom packages yet.
#
# The rootfs contents (version marker, later the OTA helper scripts) are
# delivered through the rootfs overlay referenced by BR2_ROOTFS_OVERLAY in
# configs/lab7_defconfig, so no package menu entries are needed here. This
# file exists because Buildroot requires every BR2_EXTERNAL tree to provide a
# Config.in (it is sourced into the top-level "External options" menu).
